com<\/a><\/p>","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"start","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","accordion_background":"","accordion_text_color":""}},"faq_weMq9E":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"item_wxtgXi":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What is our promise?","content":"<p>If you're not satisfied with the product or have any issues, you can return it for free within 30 days of receiving the package. Merach products come with a 2-year warranty.<\/p>"}},"item_ipmC7L":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"How long will it take to receive my device?","content":"<p>Your order will typically arrive within 3-7 business days, depending on your delivery address.<\/p>"}},"item_HXX7xV":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What is the distance unit displayed on the rowing machine?","content":"<p>The distance unit displayed on the rowing machine is in kilometers (KM).<\/p>"}},"item_DkTw8N":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What are the main types of resistance in rowing machines?","content":"<p>Rowing machines mainly use three types of resistance: air, magnetic, and water resistance.<br\/><br\/><strong>Air resistance: <\/strong>It increases with the intensity of the rowing. The harder you pull, the more resistance you feel. It provides a natural rowing experience.<br\/><br\/><strong>Magnetic resistance: <\/strong>The resistance is created using magnets. It is quieter and can be adjusted without changing the rowing speed. This type often allows for a smoother resistance throughout the rowing stroke.<br\/><br\/><strong>Water resistance:<\/strong> It simulates the feeling of rowing on water using a water-filled tank. The resistance increases with the rowing speed, providing a smooth and dynamic training experience.<\/p>"}},"item_gm8BdE":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What is a dual resistance system?","content":"<p>The dual resistance system is a combination of magnetic and water resistance that work together to enhance your workout and provide more power and rowing experience. With this system, you can adjust the resistance of your rowing machine, allowing for both a smooth and intense workout to help you achieve your fitness goals.<\/p>"}},"item_fTHWjV":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Which features are supported by the Merach app?","content":"<p>-Real-time workout tracking<br\/>-Free fitness courses<br\/>-Progress tracking and workout reports over time<br\/>-Free training mode<br\/>-Data competitions (PKs) in courses<br\/>-Innovative Real-Scene mode for an immersive training experience.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_wxtgXi","item_ipmC7L","item_HXX7xV","item_DkTw8N","item_gm8BdE","item_fTHWjV"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"FAQ","content":"","team_avatar_width":160,"support_hours":"Our customer support is available: Mon-Fri: 9 a.m. to 6 p.m. (GMT+2)","answer_time":"Closed: Saturday-Sunday and holidays.","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","accordion_background":"","accordion_text_color":""}},"rich_text_bYMtkK":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_weJAWy":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Vergleich","heading_tag":"h3","text_color":"","gradient":""}}},"block_order":["heading_weJAWy"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"anchor_id":"rich-text","full_width":true,"content_width":"small","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"comparison_table_JCaAYx":{"type":"comparison-table","blocks":{"headings_xLyFBg":{"type":"headings","settings":{"heading_1":"Modell","heading_2":"Widerstand","heading_3":"Widerstand anpassen","heading_4":"Widerstandslevels","heading_5":"App-Auto-Widerstand","heading_6":"Exklusive merach APP","heading_7":"Bluetooth-Verbindung","heading_8":"LCD-Datenmonitor","heading_9":""